Z||000013||FieroLisa||12-16-2001||11:21 AM||||If you are not interested in A, you did the right thing by telling her. Even if you don't get B, you don't want to get in a relationship with someone you're not even that interested in from the start...makes it even harder to be friends later on  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  So anyway, give A some time to digest the info that you want to just be friends with her, and then when you think there are no hard feelings there, try to see if B likes you. Prob is, if A and B are good friends and you ask B out right after you deny A, it's not gonna be a fun situation.<P>*whew* that was confusing...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.webjolt.f2s.com/pictures/fierolisa.gif">                 <BR> <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa" TARGET=_blank>FieroLisa's Website</A> *<A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa1/showdates.html" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Events 2002</A> *<A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/ncfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tarheel Fieros</A>||||reg||1
