Z||000018||FieroMontreal||12-16-2001||03:23 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Fiero*101:<BR><B>hmmmm sounds like your in quite the bind<P>ummm well i have a ? for you<BR>whats wrong with A?<BR>what does B have that A doesnt?<BR>hahah that sounds funny<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Nothing is wrong with A ... I like her.. but as a friend only.. She doesn't give me the same feeling that B gives me. A's personality is somewhat not as much to my liking.. She's more of a "stuck up" type person.<P>B on the other hand is really friendly, super fun to be around, she is really really funny... I've never felt this good around a girl for a while. Shes special I guess.. lol<P><BR>fierospeeder... trying to creat a visual basics program or what? lol<BR><P>------------------<BR> -Alex <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigfieromontrealholidays.gif"> <BR>1986 Fiero GT, STOCK Wingless, <BR>President of FieroMontreal... <A HREF="http://www.fieromontreal.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fieromontreal.com</A> <BR>and Regional Director of CFOG-I for Eastern Canada.||||reg||1
Z||000019||Peachez||12-16-2001||03:48 PM||||sounds more like solving a algebraic equation than anything.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"> but ill give you my two cents anyways. when you wrote A that letter, that was a smart move on your part.<BR>since A likes you but you don't like her...thats never gunna happen.  since you like B but not sure if she likes you...write her telling her your situation.  which means how you like her more than a friend but got a letter from her friend "A" announcing how much she likes you. then explain how you just wanna be friends with A and really wanted to see if something might work out between you and B.  say something like you dont wanna come between A and Bs friendship though and you'll wait for B till things cool over.  that way, B knows you're kinda interested in her but at the same time that you care about peoples feelings especially when its one of your friends.<BR>                                Ashley*||||reg||1
