Z||000029||Neverfinished||12-17-2001||02:07 AM||||From experience I would go for A because once B sees you with her or hears about you two she will get angry and pissed. Sounds odd??? This will leave you with the perfect angle to kiss arse to B when things don't pan out. <BR>I'm 18. I know I don't know nothing about nothing but I have this same problem with 4 girls cept I'm 'involved' with each of them.<BR>Makes life very stressful and unfair to them but two of them know about everything. <P>In conclusion ... try things with A (unless she sleeps 16 hours a day and reads romance novels... bad story, won't get into.) <BR>- If you feel awkward and things don't work out then TELL B the way you feel and things will always work out. <P>Honestly, If you sit around moping about girl problems you will make yourself feel pathetic. Have confidence and talk on the phone to them alot... Girls like the phone.<BR>and last, if that dosn't work... don't call B for a while until she misses you and wants to talk that way you won't seem desperate.<P>But what do I know I guess... I'm just an 18 year old who has no prob with ladies...<P>don't talk to A about B or your screwed!<P>------------------<BR>To Be Old And Wise, You First Must Be Young And Stupid.-----------------<BR>It's not a waste of time... If you are wasted at the time||||reg||1
