Z||000039||Peachez||12-17-2001||08:57 PM||||i think you should be straight up with A and tell her what you're feeling towards B at the current moment.  i know if a guy i liked a little told me he was diggin my friend i'd be hurt for like a day tops then i'd think about how much my friend and him had in common and would realize how much i am "getting in the way"  also i LOVE to play matchmaker, more than i do having a relationship of my own.  i dont know of a girl who doesn't like to hook her friends up.  once she gets over this jealousy stage she will wanna hook you guys up.  trust me theres no use in lying to her about B.  she obviously knows something is up otherwise she would have no clue who you liked.  if you lie to her now then she will always doubt you (girls have this thing i'd like to call ESP; it tells them when people are lying).  and when later down the road (if you decide to have things supposedly "blow over" then try to get with B later) A will get hella pissed off at you and B both like you're stabbing her in the back.  save her the heartache by telling her whats up.<BR>                                  Ashley*||||reg||1
